      "content": "I understand that it's tough to feel this way, but it's important to remember that everyone has a unique path and finds value in different ways. Your dedication and perseverance provide value and shouldn't be diminished. Instead, try to find a new direction where you can explore and innovate. Your current experiences have shaped you and given you the skills needed to achieve great things in unexpected ways. The journey to greatness doesn't always follow a perfect path, and every step you take is a valuable part of who you are. Keep pushing, stay open to new opportunities, and don't underestimate your unique capabilities and potential.",
